sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P as Producer thread
  participant T as CommandInterpolator
  participant Q as CommandRingBuffer
  participant IT as Input telemetry buffer
  participant C as Controller thread

  P->>T: submitCommand(command, receive_time)
  T->>T: Validate finite positions and joint ranges
  T->>T: Reject duplicate, out-of-order, or too-small sender interval
  alt excessive sender gap
    T->>T: Latch pending fault metadata
    T->>IT: Record RejectedSenderGap
    T-->>P: RejectedSenderGap
    Note over C,T: Producer never mutates controller-owned state
  else invalid command
    T->>IT: Record rejection and original timestamps
    T-->>P: rejection result
  else valid command
    T->>Q: tryPush(command)
    alt ring full
      Q-->>T: false
      T->>IT: Record RejectedBufferFull
      T-->>P: RejectedBufferFull
    else accepted
      Q-->>T: true
      T->>T: Publish newest accepted sender and receive times
      T->>IT: Record Accepted
      T-->>P: Accepted
    end
  end
